children.push(para("On the call, Eric floated the idea of starting with 50 clinics and seeing what's possible. We agree, and we want to bring real structure to that number rather than leave it as a hypothetical."));

children.push(h3("Why 50, not 500"));

children.push(para("Your salesforce signs roughly 100 clinics a month. We're not asking for the firehose. We're asking for a controlled cohort where both sides can measure what happens when WellSync supply meets Luxora revenue infrastructure inside the same clinic. 50 clinics is large enough to surface a real pattern, small enough that nothing gets dropped, and structured enough that the data tells us whether to scale or stop."));

children.push(h3("Who the pilot serves"));

children.push(para("We'd recommend pulling from two pools:"));

children.push(bulletMixed("Pool A: Existing BoomRx clinics in the 40% that aren't yet everyday orderers. ", "These are the clinics your account management team is already revisiting. Adding Luxora as a revenue partner solves the underlying issue, which is usually that the clinic isn't converting enough consults to drive consistent ordering volume."));
children.push(bulletMixed("Pool B: Brand-new medspas your reps are signing. ", "On the call, Eric mentioned WellSync is rolling out a starter package for new operators in the next 60 days, targeting states without in-person GLP-1 prescription restrictions. That cohort is exactly where Luxora's new Launch Track lives, more on that in Section Three. Pairing day-one supply with day-one revenue infrastructure is the cleanest version of this partnership."));

children.push(h3("How the pilot is structured"));

children.push(para("A 90-day window with a defined offer:"));

children.push(bulletMixed("Pricing for the pilot cohort. ", "$2,500 entry pricing for our condensed Launch Track delivery (a productized version of the 90-Day Growth Engine, pulled forward specifically for this partnership). Standard pricing is $9,000. The pilot rate is the volume discount in exchange for a structured cohort and shared data."));
children.push(bulletMixed("What every pilot clinic gets. ", "Revenue Leak Audit, Market Blueprint for their geography, package and stack architecture (built around BoomRx products from day one), staff sales training, AI follow-up four-agent system (lead triage, dead-lead reactivation, no-show recovery, review harvesting), and the partnership ecosystem."));
children.push(bulletMixed("What WellSync gets in return. ", "Direct line to ordering velocity inside the cohort, before-and-after metrics tied to specific clinics, and a co-branded case study library that supports your salesforce in the broader market."));

children.push(h3("What we'll measure together"));

children.push(bullet("BoomRx order frequency and basket size before and after the 90-day window"));
children.push(bullet("Stack adoption rate (single-product orders vs multi-product orders) inside the cohort"));
children.push(bullet("Consult-to-close conversion shift inside Luxora-installed clinics"));
children.push(bullet("Patient LTV trajectory in the 90 days following Luxora installation"));
children.push(bullet("Net new clinics signed where the joint offer was the deciding factor"));

children.push(callout([
  { t: "If 50 clinics in a 90-day pilot move the BoomRx order needle measurably, we have a real partnership. If they don't, we both walk away with data and no obligation. That's the deal we're proposing.", italics: true, color: NAVY },
]));

children.push(pageBreak());

// ===== SECTION THREE: THE LAUNCH TRACK ==================================

children.push(sectionLabel("Section three"));
children.push(h1("Where we want your input"));
children.push(h2("The brand-new medspa Launch Track"));

children.push(para("On the call, Eric mentioned WellSync is preparing a starter package for brand-new clinics. We've been building a parallel track on our side, and we think the timing is too clean to ignore."));

children.push(h3("What we're seeing"));

children.push(para("Our 90-Day Growth Engine was built around operators who already have three to six staff and an existing client base. That's still our core. But since relaunching in January, we've been getting steady inbound from a different audience: brand-new owners who haven't opened the doors yet, or who opened recently and are still figuring out what they don't know. Historically we turned most of these conversations away or referred them out. We've been leaving real revenue on the table, and so have they."));

children.push(para("Here's the pattern. A new owner spends $300K-plus on build-out, signs a lease, finances 14 lasers, and only then starts asking the questions they should have asked first. What's my market actually paying for? What service mix matches my geography? What's my package architecture? Who's writing my prescriptions? Where am I sourcing my GLP-1s? By the time they call us, the room is already working against them."));

children.push(h3("Why we want WellSync embedded as the supply anchor"));

children.push(bulletMixed("Catching new operators before they sign with the wrong pharmacy protects everyone. ", "Right now, brand-new owners are getting pitched by aggregators and one-off compounding pharmacies with no quality chain and no real network. WellSync becomes the day-one recommendation, not the replacement they have to make 18 months in after a quality issue."));
children.push(bulletMixed("It positions WellSync as the supply authority from day one. ", "Not the alternative they swap to once their first pharmacy fails them. Day one. Built into the playbook."));
children.push(bulletMixed("It addresses the exact cohort your starter package is built for. ", "Joe and Eric, you mentioned the 60-day rollout targeting non-restricted GLP-1 states. We can match that timeline."));

children.push(h3("How the Launch Track works"));

children.push(bulletMixed("The track itself. ", "A pre-opening or first-year program covering market validation, service mix design, pricing strategy, brand positioning, vendor selection, hiring framework, KPI setup, and supply chain decisions including pharmacy and prescriber selection."));
children.push(bulletMixed("WellSync's role inside it. ", "Featured supply partner. Every brand-new owner who comes through Luxora gets a structured introduction to BoomRx as the recommended pharmacy and prescriber network. Co-branded materials. Direct line into your sales team for cohort onboarding."));
children.push(bulletMixed("Luxora's role on your side. ", "Featured growth partner inside WellSync's referral pipeline for the $500K to $2M segment plus the new starter cohort, filling the revenue-side gap you mentioned you don't currently have covered."));
children.push(bulletMixed("Pricing tier. ", "Launch Track priced at $2,500 (same as the pilot cohort), accessible for early-stage operators. The goal is volume and long-term partnership, not a high-ticket gate. Owners who graduate move into our Inner Circle at $2,500/month for ongoing partnership, which is when supply consumption matures into recurring patterns."));

children.push(h3("What we'd love from you"));

children.push(para("Honest input on the structure. What scopes and price points do you want represented? What guardrails do you want around how WellSync is positioned in our materials? What does your sales team need from us to make the handoff seamless? We'd rather build this with you than build it and ask you to plug in."));

children.push(pageBreak());

// ===== SECTION FOUR: THE EXCHANGE ========================================

children.push(sectionLabel("Section four"));
children.push(h1("The exchange"));

children.push(para("Below is a side-by-side of what each business brings to the alliance. Some of this is what we discussed live. Some is built on top of that conversation. All of it is a starting point we can shape together."));

children.push(spacer(120));

children.push(exchangeTable([
  [
    "Featured supply partner across all Luxora client onboarding, with WellSync / BoomRx positioned as the recommended pharmacy, prescriber connection, and compounded prescription network.",
    "Featured growth partner inside WellSync's referral ecosystem, filling the revenue-side gap for the $500K to $2M independent medspa segment and the brand-new operator cohort."
  ],
  [
    "Embedded role in the new Launch Track for brand-new medspa owners. Direct access to pre-opening operators making major supply chain decisions before they sign with the wrong pharmacy.",
    "Supply chain contribution to the Launch Track playbook, including recommended product stacks, pricing tiers, and prescriber connection guidance for early-stage operators."
  ],
  [
    "50-clinic pilot cohort designed around your existing BoomRx network and new starter package, with shared metrics tracking ordering velocity, basket size, and stack adoption.",
    "50 clinic introductions for the pilot cohort, drawn from existing under-utilized accounts plus new operators signing in the rollout window. Shared data on ordering patterns."
  ],
  [
    "Stack architecture designed around BoomRx products. The grand-slam offer model Jacques walked through on the call: weight loss stacks, performance stacks, repair stacks, glow stacks, all pulling from your network instead of fragmented sourcing.",
    "Bulk pricing and quality assurance built into every Luxora client stack, with the single-shipping-fee model that makes multi-product packages economically viable for the medspa to deliver."
  ],
  [
    "Dedicated section on theluxoracollective.co featuring WellSync as our recommended supply and prescription partner, with case study placement from the pilot cohort.",
    "Reciprocal placement on WellSync touchpoints positioning Luxora as the recommended growth partner for clinics that need consult conversion, package architecture, and revenue infrastructure."
  ],
  [
    "Luxora's four-agent AI system (lead triage, dead-lead reactivation, no-show recovery, review harvesting plus social listening) installed in pilot clinics, driving the patient volume that drives BoomRx order frequency.",
    "Direct integration paths where appropriate, so Luxora-installed clinics can connect their CRM and follow-up systems to BoomRx ordering velocity for joint reporting."
  ],
  [
    "Podcast feature on The Aesthetic and Wellness Edge. A full episode dedicated to WellSync, the BoomRx network, the quality-chain story, and Joe's perspective on the supply layer of the industry.",
    "Distribution support across WellSync's clinic network and any owned media, plus introductions where it makes sense to your EMR partners and aggregator relationships."
  ],
  [
    "Co-authored Supply Chain & Stack Architecture Playbook inside our 90-Day Growth Engine, walking owners through how to source, prescribe, package, and price compounded products. WellSync embedded by name throughout.",
    "Input on the playbook content, pricing benchmarks, prescription workflow accuracy, and quality standards represented to your specifications."
  ],
  [
    "Cross-promotion across our blog, newsletter, social, and the upcoming workshop series. Two- to three-hour virtual workshops scoped for late 2026, with live events to follow.",
    "Cross-promotion to your existing clinic base. Warm introductions where Luxora is a fit, plus joint workshop and content collaboration once the pilot has earned its keep."
  ],
  [
    "Introductions to our active partner ecosystem: Aesthetic Injector Academy (Tracy Olson), Acorn Biolabs (regenerative medicine and stem cell banking), payment processing, partnership development specialists, and select private equity contacts for clinics positioning for acquisition.",
    "Introductions to your established prescriber network, EMR partners, and any clinic-side technology providers relevant for Luxora clients. Broader supply-chain insight for joint client work."
  ],
  [
    "Confidential Experience Assessment (the secret shopper service) for any of your existing BoomRx clinics that would benefit from an outside-eye operational audit.",
    "Quality and pricing review for Luxora clients flagged during Revenue Leak Audits as having product sourcing or prescription workflow issues holding back revenue."
  ],
]));

children.push(pageBreak());

// ===== SECTION FIVE: HOW WE'D LIKE TO BUILD THIS ========================

children.push(sectionLabel("Section five"));
children.push(h1("How we'd like to build this"));

children.push(para("On the call, both sides agreed: nobody wants to oversell what's possible and end up disappointed. We don't either. Here's the runway we're proposing, with clear off-ramps at every stage."));

children.push(h3("Phase One: 50-Clinic Pilot (Months 1-4)"));

children.push(para("The lowest-commitment way to test the thesis. WellSync introduces 50 clinics into the Luxora program at $2,500 per clinic. Both sides instrument the data. No exclusivity. No formal alliance beyond the pilot agreement."));

children.push(bulletMixed("Concrete first moves: ", "WellSync identifies the 50 clinics from Pool A and Pool B in the first 30 days. Luxora onboards in waves of 10 to 15. Joint scorecard built in week one. Bethany books a podcast episode with Joe in the first 60 days. Eric and Joe align on the EMR-side reporting we'd need to track ordering velocity."));

children.push(h3("Phase Two: Embedded Partnership (Months 5-9)"));

children.push(para("If Phase One delivers, we go deeper. WellSync becomes the named supply partner inside the Launch Track. The Supply Chain & Stack Architecture Playbook gets co-authored and distributed. Reciprocal positioning becomes formal across both businesses. Joint case studies enter your sales team's outreach."));

children.push(bulletMixed("Concrete moves: ", "Launch Track soft-launched with the first new-operator cohort, paired with the WellSync starter package. Co-branded content series live. Joint workshop scoped and scheduled. Pilot cohort renewals into Inner Circle measured."));

children.push(h3("Phase Three: Strategic Alliance (Month 10+)"));

children.push(para("If the volume, the data, and the chemistry are there, we have the conversation about something more formal. That could look like primary growth-partner status for Luxora across the BoomRx network, primary supply-partner status for WellSync across Luxora's client base, joint live events, deeper revenue-share structures, or category-exclusive arrangements in defined geographies. We'd build that conversation around real numbers, not assumptions."));

children.push(callout([
  { t: "Why this progression", bold: true, color: NAVY },
  { t: "We have two existing growth partners who work exclusively with Luxora. Both started as Phase One affiliates. We don't believe in locking anyone in until the partnership has earned the right to be that close. The phased model protects both businesses, and gives your salesforce something concrete to share with the next cohort of clinics they sign.", color: "333333" },
]));

children.push(pageBreak());

// ===== SECTION SIX: ABOUT LUXORA ========================================

children.push(sectionLabel("Section six"));
children.push(h1("About The Luxora Collective"));

children.push(para("So you have everything you need in one place, here's the snapshot."));

children.push(h3("The model"));

children.push(para("Luxora is a premium revenue growth partner for independent medspas generating $500K to $2M annually. Owners built their business to offer transformation, not manage spreadsheets. Luxora makes the business reflect that vision."));

children.push(para("We work from the inside out. We start with a Revenue Leak Audit, recovering revenue lost to undertrained front desks, unconverted consults, stagnant clients, missing memberships, and weak packages. Then we deliver a full Market Blueprint of their area before recommending any new investment. Once the foundation is solid, we install the right services at the right time: staff sales training, systems that run without the owner in every transaction, memberships, package architecture, AI follow-up, CRM, partnerships, reputation engine, marketing, and LTV frameworks."));

children.push(para("It's done-with-you, with knowledge transfer at every step. Most clients move into a month-to-month Inner Circle relationship after the 90 days, and we prefer one-year-plus partnerships. The goal is for the owner to be more capable, more confident, and more in control, not dependent on us."));

children.push(h3("The four-agent AI system"));

children.push(para("Built specifically for medspas, deployed inside every Luxora client:"));

children.push(bulletMixed("Lead triage agent. ", "Inbound leads warmed, qualified, and booked into consults within five minutes. Solves the single biggest gap most medspas have: nobody sitting by the phone."));
children.push(bulletMixed("Dead-lead reactivation. ", "Fires after the standard 14-day sales cycle to warm cold leads back into the funnel."));
children.push(bulletMixed("No-show recovery. ", "Reminds patients 24 hours out, handles rescheduling, and reduces missed appointments."));
children.push(bulletMixed("Review harvesting. ", "Post-visit, routes 3-or-less ratings to a manager for service recovery, routes 4-and-5 ratings into review requests."));

children.push(para("All four agents tie into social listening, so any comment on the clinic's social channels feeds back into the system. This is the patient-volume engine that drives the BoomRx ordering velocity we'd be measuring in the pilot."));

children.push(h3("The team"));

children.push(bulletMixed("Bethany Anne, Co-Founder & CEO. ", "Seventeen years in aesthetics and marketing. Started in 2008 in dermatology and plastics in California. Front desk, medical assisting, surgical tech, cosmetic sales, billing, then management of three locations, twelve surgeons, eight doctors, forty-four staff. Built three marketing agencies. Host of The Aesthetic and Wellness Edge podcast."));
children.push(bulletMixed("Eric, Co-Founder & CFO. ", "Has bought, scaled, and sold multiple seven and eight-figure companies. CEO of operations with 600 to 700 employees. Brings the operational and acquisition rigor that lets us scale Luxora into a volume model."));
children.push(bulletMixed("Jacques, Tech, Media, and Meta Ads. ", "The ad architecture, the four-agent AI system, and the offer-stacking engine you saw on the call. Built the systems that turn $123 leads into $9 leads."));
children.push(bulletMixed("Aanchal, Executive Coordination. ", "Manages outreach, content coordination, and operational continuity across the team."));

children.push(h3("The 90-Day Growth Engine offer"));

children.push(bulletMixed("Standard investment: ", "$9,000 over three months. Pilot cohort and Launch Track investment: $2,500."));
children.push(bulletMixed("Guarantee: ", "We double the client's investment in new and recurring revenue, identified during the Revenue Leak Audit, within the engagement period."));
children.push(bulletMixed("Structure: ", "Nine sequenced playbooks delivered over the 90 days. Bi-weekly check-ins. Embedded AI prompts. Knowledge transfer model where clients implement through their own staff with our frameworks."));
children.push(bulletMixed("After 90 days: ", "Optional move into the Inner Circle for ongoing partnership at $2,500/month."));

children.push(h3("Strategic ecosystem"));

children.push(para("Active partnerships and alliances include Aesthetic Injector Academy (Tracy Olson), Acorn Biolabs (regenerative medicine and stem cell banking), aesthetics-focused payment processing, and select private equity contacts for clients ready to position for acquisition. We are actively building the supply layer of this ecosystem, which is where WellSync comes in."));

children.push(pageBreak());

// ===== SECTION SEVEN: WHAT WE'D LOVE FROM THE NEXT CONVERSATION =========

children.push(sectionLabel("Section seven"));
children.push(h1("What we'd love from the next conversation"));

children.push(para("This proposal isn't the close. It's the structured version of what we discussed Tuesday, so we can have a sharper conversation when we reconvene. Here's what we're hoping to walk away with:"));

children.push(bulletMixed("Your reaction to the 50-clinic pilot. ", "Does the structure work? Are Pool A and Pool B the right cohort definitions? What metrics matter most to your team? What does WellSync need built into the agreement to make it operationally clean on your side?"));
children.push(bulletMixed("Your input on the Launch Track. ", "Is the brand-new operator cohort the right place to embed WellSync, given your 60-day rollout? What scopes and price points should be represented? What do you want excluded?"));
children.push(bulletMixed("Calendar alignment. ", "When does the pilot officially kick off? When would the first cohort of 10 to 15 clinics be ready for Luxora onboarding? Who on each side is the day-one point person?"));
children.push(bulletMixed("Anything we've missed. ", "If there's a way to structure this that serves WellSync better, we want to hear it now, not three months in. Joe, you mentioned a tier-two offering at around $19/month for participating clinics. We'd love to talk about how Luxora plugs into that, if at all."));

children.push(h3("One more thing"));

children.push(callout([
  { t: "\"It boils down to that price moat. When you start with the API and you make it all the way to the pharmacy, there's a whole lot of cost and profit for the players in that space that you can lean off and therefore provide greater value to each of the clinics that use our services.\" — Joe", italics: true, color: NAVY, size: 22 },
  { t: "We agree. Our job is to make sure the clinics actually use that value, often enough, with packages large enough, and with patient volume high enough, that the moat compounds for everyone in the loop.", color: "333333", size: 22 },
]));

children.push(para("Eric and I are in. We just want to do it the right way, with the right structure, so that a year from now we're looking at real numbers and a real partnership, not a handshake that faded.", { before: 200 }));

children.push(para("Looking forward to the next call.", { before: 120 }));

children.push(spacer(160));
children.push(para("Bethany Anne & Eric", { bold: true }));
children.push(para("The Luxora Collective", { color: GREY, before: 0 }));
children.push(para("theluxoracollective.co", { color: GREY, italics: true, before: 0 }));

// ----- Document assembly -------------------------------------------------

const doc = new Document({
  creator: "The Luxora Collective",
  title: "Luxora x WellSync Strategic Partnership Proposal",
  description: "Strategic partnership proposal between The Luxora Collective and WellSync / BoomRx",
