// --- Prompt 4 ---
children.push(h3("Prompt 4: Membership Conversion Script"));

children.push(para("Use case: generate a personalized membership pitch for a patient already in your system who has had two or more visits but hasn't joined a membership tier yet."));

children.push(promptBlock("Prompt", `You are writing a personalized message from [SPA NAME] to an existing patient inviting them to consider one of our membership tiers.

Patient profile:
- Name: [PATIENT NAME]
- Visit history: [LIST OF SERVICES AND DATES]
- Total spend year-to-date: [AMOUNT]
- Stated goals from past consults: [LIST]
- Best stack match: [STACK NAME]

Membership tiers:
1. Glow Member, $197/month, foundation tier (facial, scan, 10% off, member events)
2. Longevity Member, $497/month, includes injections, scans, lab panels, 15% off, concierge access
3. Concierge Circle, $1,497/month, includes monthly peptide protocol, full labs, strategy calls, 20% off

Write a personalized message that:
1. References two specific past services they've had with us.
2. Calculates roughly what they would have saved year-to-date if they'd been on the appropriate tier.
3. Recommends the tier that best matches their behavior and goals (not the most expensive, the most appropriate).
4. Offers to book a 15-minute call to walk them through it, or a one-click yes if they're ready.

Tone: warm, friendly, confident. Treat the patient like a long-term relationship, not a transaction. Use contractions. No pushy language. Sign off from [CONSULTANT NAME].`));

// --- Prompt 5 ---
children.push(h3("Prompt 5: Social Content from Patient Wins"));

children.push(para("Use case: turn a single patient milestone (a 30-day, 90-day, or annual outcome) into a week's worth of branded social content."));

children.push(promptBlock("Prompt", `You are the content engine for [SPA NAME]. A patient just hit a meaningful milestone in their [STACK NAME] protocol.

Patient milestone details:
- Stack: [WEIGHT / LONGEVITY / GLOW / TAN / GUT]
- Timeframe: [30 / 60 / 90 / 180 / 365 days]
- Specific result: [OBJECTIVE OUTCOME, anonymized]
- Anonymized quote from the patient: [QUOTE]
- Visual asset available: [BEFORE-AND-AFTER / SCAN COMPARISON / NONE]

Generate one week of content (5 posts) from this single story:

Post 1 (Monday): The story, told in 4 to 6 sentences. No salesy language. Just the arc.
Post 2 (Tuesday): The science behind why this stack works. Educational, not promotional.
Post 3 (Wednesday): A myth-busting carousel script. 5 slides, plain-English captions.
Post 4 (Thursday): A behind-the-scenes look at what the consult actually involves.
Post 5 (Friday): A direct invitation to book a longevity consult, tied back to the patient story.

For each post, give me:
