children.push(sectionLabel("Section four"));
children.push(h1("The longevity consult framework"));

children.push(para("Most medspas run a 20 minute consult. That works fine for a single Botox treatment. It does not work for selling a $4,000 package or a $497 monthly membership. The longevity consult is a 45 to 60 minute conversation, structured in six phases, designed to close at a meaningfully higher price point."));

children.push(para("If your front desk or consultant cannot run this consult, that is the first thing Luxora will train them on inside the 90-Day Growth Engine. The script below is the same framework we use with every Luxora client.", { italics: true, color: GREY }));

children.push(h3("Phase One: Welcome and Reframe (5 minutes)"));

children.push(para("The patient walks in expecting to be sold a single service. Reframe the conversation in the first three minutes. \"Before we talk about any specific treatment, I want to understand where you actually want to be 90 days, 6 months, and 12 months from now. That conversation is going to lead us to the right starting point, not the other way around.\""));

children.push(h3("Phase Two: Discovery (15 minutes)"));

children.push(bullet("What does an ideal day look like for you 90 days from now?"));
children.push(bullet("What's actually getting in the way? Energy, sleep, body composition, skin, gut, hormones?"));
children.push(bullet("What have you already tried? What worked? What didn't?"));
children.push(bullet("If we solved the top three things on your list, what would that be worth to you?"));
children.push(bullet("Who else benefits when you feel and look the way you want to?"));

children.push(h3("Phase Three: Assessment (10 minutes)"));

children.push(para("Run the visual or measurement-based assessment relevant to their stated goal. Body composition scan if it's weight or longevity. VISIA or skin scan if it's glow. Lab pull request if it's gut, hormones, or performance. The patient needs to see data, not opinion."));

children.push(h3("Phase Four: The Stack Match (10 minutes)"));

children.push(para("This is where you map their answers to one of the five core stacks. Frame it as a clinical match, not a sales push. \"Based on what you just told me and what we just measured, you're a match for our Weight & Metabolic Reset stack with a Gut Reset add-on. Here's what that protocol looks like.\""));

children.push(para("Pull out the actual package brochure. Walk them through the stack. Show them the stand-alone value column. Then, only then, show them the package price. The reframe from \"this is what it costs\" to \"this is what you save\" happens visually, not verbally.", { before: 120 }));

children.push(h3("Phase Five: The Membership Layer (8 minutes)"));

children.push(para("Once the package is on the table, layer the membership. \"Most patients who do this 90-day package join one of our membership tiers at the end so the work doesn't reverse. Some patients join the membership at the start because the value of bundling is bigger. Here are the three tiers.\""));

children.push(para("Show all three. Let them self-select. Most will pick the middle tier."));

children.push(h3("Phase Six: The Close (7 to 10 minutes)"));

children.push(para("Three options on the table. Single-pay package. Payment plan with Klarna or Affirm. Package plus membership bundle. Quote a single number. Let them ask the question. Answer with confidence."));

children.push(para("If they push back on price, do not discount. Restate the value. Offer the payment plan. If they still push back, offer the smallest entry point (Gut Reset Starter or Glow Member) as the on-ramp. Never break the pricing structure of the larger packages, because that is how you train your market to wait for the discount.", { before: 120, italics: true, color: GREY }));

