Generate one week of content (5 posts) from this single story:

Post 1 (Monday): The story, told in 4 to 6 sentences. No salesy language. Just the arc.
Post 2 (Tuesday): The science behind why this stack works. Educational, not promotional.
Post 3 (Wednesday): A myth-busting carousel script. 5 slides, plain-English captions.
Post 4 (Thursday): A behind-the-scenes look at what the consult actually involves.
Post 5 (Friday): A direct invitation to book a longevity consult, tied back to the patient story.

For each post, give me:
- Caption (under 220 characters for Instagram)
- 3 to 5 relevant hashtags
- Suggested visual or carousel structure

Tone: premium, educational, confident. Never use the word \"transformation\" lazily. Avoid before-and-after thirst-trap clichés. Use natural contractions. No em dashes. We are positioning ourselves as the smartest, most credible option in our market.`));

// --- Prompt 6 ---
children.push(h3("Prompt 6: Front Desk Objection Handler"));

children.push(para("Use case: real-time training tool for your front desk and consultants. When a patient pushes back on price, this prompt generates a confident, on-brand response in under 10 seconds."));

children.push(promptBlock("Prompt", `You are coaching the front desk team at [SPA NAME] in real time. A patient just objected to a package or membership price. The objection is: [PASTE EXACT OBJECTION].

Generate three response options the consultant can use immediately:

Option 1: Restate the value. Walk through the stand-alone value of every component in the package and remind the patient what they're actually getting. Keep it under 60 seconds spoken.

Option 2: Offer the payment plan or alternative entry point. Klarna or Affirm financing for the full package, or the lowest-tier on-ramp (Gut Reset Starter at $897, or Glow Member at $197/month). Keep it under 45 seconds spoken.

Option 3: The graceful exit. If the patient is clearly not the right fit, give the consultant a script that closes the conversation warmly without discounting, leaving the door open for a future return. Keep it under 30 seconds spoken.

Critical rules:
- Never discount the package price. We don't break pricing.
- Never sound desperate. We're confident in the value.
- Always preserve the patient relationship. Even a no today is a yes in 6 months if we handle it well.
- Use natural contractions, like a real human in conversation.
- No corporate language. No \"I understand your hesitation\" robot phrases.`));

children.push(pageBreak());

// ===== CLOSE ==============================================================

children.push(sectionLabel("How to put this into motion"));
children.push(h1("Your next 30 days"));

children.push(para("This playbook works only when it leaves the page. Here's the order of operations we recommend for getting it into your spa within 30 days, without breaking anything that's already working."));

children.push(h3("Week One"));
children.push(bullet("Sit with your medical director or prescriber. Walk through the five stacks. Identify which ones are appropriate for your license, your state, and your prescriber agreement."));
children.push(bullet("Pick your two starting stacks. Most owners begin with Weight & Metabolic and Glow & Skin because they map to existing patient demand."));
children.push(bullet("Set your pricing using the framework in Section Three as a starting point. Adjust against your cost basis."));

children.push(h3("Week Two"));
children.push(bullet("Build your two starter packages and one membership tier (recommend starting with Longevity Member at $497/mo)."));
children.push(bullet("Train your front desk on the longevity consult framework. Practice with each other, not with patients first."));
children.push(bullet("Update your CRM with the stack names, package names, and pricing."));

children.push(h3("Week Three"));
children.push(bullet("Set up the AI prompts in your follow-up system. Start with Prompt 1 (Lead Triage) and Prompt 2 (Post-Consult Follow-Up). Those two alone will move the needle."));
children.push(bullet("Run your first longevity consult on a real patient. Record what worked and what didn't."));
children.push(bullet("Refine the consult script based on what you learned."));

children.push(h3("Week Four"));
children.push(bullet("Launch one stack-based offer publicly (email list, social, in-spa signage)."));
children.push(bullet("Track three numbers: consult-to-close rate, average package price sold, and membership conversion rate."));
children.push(bullet("Bring those three numbers to your next Luxora bi-weekly call. We'll calibrate from there."));

