// --- Prompt 1: Stack Builder ---
children.push(promptBlock({
  title: "Prompt 1 — The Stack Builder",
  useFor: "Designing a custom package for a specific patient profile",
  prompt:
`You are a senior medspa strategist who specializes in stacked offers, not discounts.

Here is what my medspa currently offers:
[paste your full service menu with retail prices]

Here is the patient profile:
- Age: [age]
- Primary goal: [weight loss / glow / performance / longevity / etc.]
- Secondary concerns: [list]
- Budget comfort: [range]
- Timeline: [30 / 60 / 90 / 120 days]
- Has tried before: [list]

Build me a stacked package with:
1. A hero product (the one thing that gets them in the door)
2. A clinical wrap (consults, labs, follow-ups, supervision)
3. A complementary peptide or wellness layer
4. Two tangibles (something physical they leave with)
5. The retail value, package price, and patient savings

Format the output as a one-page consult sheet I can read out loud.`
}));

children.push(spacer(180));

