I want to design a [name of tier] membership that:
- Has a first-month profitable structure
- Has a stack value 2.5–4x the monthly price
- Includes services I already offer (list below)
- Adds [peptide / IV / wellness layer] without overcommitting clinical time

My current services and retail prices:
[paste service list]

Build me three pricing options (entry, recommended, premium) with:
- Monthly price
- What's included
- Stack value calculation
- Ideal patient profile
- One sentence I can put on my website`
}));

